          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തുടക്കം (tuṭakkaṁ) is native Dravidian, the noun of തുടങ്ങുക (tuṭaṅṅuka), \"to begin\" (DEDR 3481), as ഒടുക്കം is the noun of ഒടുങ്ങുക."
